    "text": "Three blisters of 2007, each with one of the Sinnoh first partners as a holofoil promo: Turtwig DP01, the first Diamond & Pearl Black Star Promo, Chimchar DP02 or Piplup DP03. The Chimchar blister, announced in May 2007 for a June release, held two Diamond & Pearl booster packs, an EX Power Keepers pack and a Palkia coin. All three pictures first came in Japan, on cards of Meiji's February 2007 series of Pokémon chocolate promos.",
